# 🍕 SliceDash

A full-stack pizza delivery application built using the MERN stack, with an AI-powered PizzaBot for menu, cart, order, cancellation, deletion, and checkout assistance.

## 🚀 Live Demo

Frontend: https://slice-dash.vercel.app/

Backend API: https://slice-dash-backend.onrender.com

AI Service: https://slice-dash-ai-services.onrender.com

## ✨ Features

### 👤 User
- User registration and login
- JWT authentication
- Profile management
- Address management
- Browse available pizzas
- Pizza search/filtering
- Add pizzas to cart
- Update cart quantity
- Remove cart items
- Checkout with Cash on Delivery
- View order history
- Cancel eligible orders
- Delete orders

### 👨‍💼 Admin
- Admin authentication
- Admin dashboard
- View order statistics
- View all orders
- Update order status
- Manage pizzas and categories

### 🤖 PizzaBot
- AI-powered pizza assistant
- Real-time menu information
- Pizza availability and pricing
- Add pizzas to cart using natural language
- View cart
- View order history
- Check order status
- Cancel orders
- Delete orders
- Checkout assistance
- Uses backend tools instead of inventing application data

