└── README.md

## 🔐 Authentication

JWT-based authentication is used to protect user and admin routes.

Passwords are hashed using bcrypt before being stored.

## 🤖 AI Architecture

The PizzaBot uses an AI service built with FastAPI.

The AI can call application tools such as:

- get_pizzas
- get_pizza_by_name
- add_to_cart
- get_cart
- get_my_orders
- cancel_order
- delete_order
- checkout

The tools communicate with the SliceDash backend API to retrieve or modify real application data.

## 📌 Future Improvements

